      <title>Democrats Clinch 258 House Seats, an Election-Year Record This Century</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/22/us/politics/democrats-midterm-house-majority-record.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/22/us/politics/democrats-midterm-house-majority-record.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:08:38 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/06/multimedia/00pol-dems-house-majority-hfo-vwlm/00pol-dems-house-majority-hfo-vwlm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/06/multimedia/00pol-dems-house-majority-hfo-vwlm/00pol-dems-house-majority-hfo-vwlm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/06/multimedia/00pol-dems-house-majority-hfo-vwlm/00pol-dems-house-majority-hfo-vwlm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Democrats Clinch 258 House Seats, an Election-Year Record This Century" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After sweeping midterm wins, Democrats have secured the largest House majority in a national election for either party in three decades.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
