      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/22/multimedia/22pol-gop-reflection-SWAP-mblz/22pol-gop-reflection-SWAP-mblz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Republicans Debate Why They Lost the Midterms, and if Trump Is to Blame" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A divide is emerging in the party over what caused its wipeout midterm defeats, foreshadowing a battle over how to move forward before 2028.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
